    "enUS": {
      "description": "As Lady Amberhall's apprentice in the dark arts, I may not look it but I'm usually quite capable of handling things on my own. I did not, however, anticipate an entire cave of void-infused ogres.\r\n\r\nIf you managed to get all the way down here without being captured, you must be powerful yourself. I was not so lucky with those ogres and their masters roaming about. Do the world a favor and kill the hideous beasts. Nothing good comes from a fanatic with a purpose, empowered or otherwise.",
      "dialogue": {
        "5dd0d3e8c8b95569deb2": "You managed to put down a fair number of those beasts. The Twilight's Hammer will reel at their losses today."
      },
